{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layla is bored and wants to play a game with you. According to her, you must take turns counting upwards in groups of up to 3. But you must count in a way that you don\u2019t end up being the one to say the number 21.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While her game\u2019s premise is staggeringly simple, it will require the use of some of your finest brain cells to figure out how to beat her. And if you do, you\u2019ll get an achievement.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPORTANT:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 'How to play' trailer is for entertainment purposes only. When you play the actual game, Layla will not tolerate any funny business. You can only play by the rules - there are no dialog options for illegal game moves. The goal is simply to beat her 5x in a row for the achievement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press spacebar to count when it\u2019s your turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included with your purchase:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple but perplexing arithmetic challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single button gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spoken dialog with subtitles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The numbers 1 through 21</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An annoying girl (ft Layla)\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951700?t=1755906794","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951700?t=1755906794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951700/b49528f82b532e642d39d98a39968c5105f2ba55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755906794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951700/b49528f82b532e642d39d98a39968c5105f2ba55/ca